  "description": "Get ready for excitement, jaw-dropping shows, adrenaline-pumping rides and endless movie-themed fun for the entire family at Dubai Parks and Resorts. Sprawling over 25 million square feet (about the size of a small country), Dubai Parks and Resorts™ is home to MOTIONGATE™ Dubai, BOLLYWOOD PARKS™ Dubai, LEGOLAND ® Dubai and LEGOLAND ® Water Park, the region’s first splash-tastic destination for families with kids aged 2 – 12. Each theme park is bursting with unbelievable entertainment for little (and big) ones…meet the Smurfs, dance with the animals from Madagascar, go on wild rides through magical worlds inspired by every kid’s favourite movies and pure imagination, the list goes on and on! We’ve also got plenty of facilities to make your visit better, including stroller rentals, locker facilities and oodles of kids’ meals that will make even the fussiest eaters smile. All you need to do is show up and get ready for the time of your life.",
